y. Love it.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggS2BQLjIxB_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggS2BQLjIxB_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Mothers_Day_Rachael_9x16-51.87.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxRiV5kOUa_text","label":"ggxRiV5kOUa_text","default":"<p><i>Leslie B.</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqsIlgM4FS_text","label":"ggqsIlgM4FS_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">\"I have been kicking this purchase around for too long. Finally pulled the trigger and I couldn't be happier with the results. Very easy to use. I backed up everything from my Android phone then transferred all of those files to my laptop. Very happy with this purchase.\"</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBtSqotnCn_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggBtSqotnCn_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Billo_Review_Merri_9x16-28.83.png"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-qRaKtm2I_text","label":"gg-qRaKtm2I_text","default":"<p><i>Merri D.</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0Xy-YqjJk_text","label":"gg0Xy-YqjJk_text","default":"<p>\"This stick holds thousands of pictures and videos. Then you can plug it in to your TV or laptop and look through the pictures or watch the videos. No more buying storage or being afraid of losing your memories if you phone breaks. I am going to get one for everyone in my household so they can always have their memories saved.\"</p>"}],
